          "abridged": false,
          "description": "When the little dinos of Brookwood can’t sleep, when tails twitch, wings flap, and worries rumble, there’s one friend they can always count on: Yawn-o-Saurus. With his soft scarf, calm steps, and basket of bedtime treasures, he knows just how to bring peace to even the wiggliest nights. Listeners follow Yawn-o-Saurus as he helps his dino friends settle in for rest: from the itchy tails and restless nights of The Wiggle Night to the tangled Blanket Mix-Up, the No-Nap Dino, the Snore, and more. ",
